{"text":"Relationships, career, are not destinations, like, look, I found the job I love. That's not how it works. It's not a scavenger hunt. I'm looking for the job that will, no, it doesn't work that way. It's a journey. It's the same with love. It's like, I found love. No, you didn't. You work hard every single day to stay in love. It's a journey. It's as if they're standing at the foot of a mountain. They know exactly what they want. They can see the summit. What they don't see is the mountain. I talked to some recent college grads who are in their entry-level jobs on a regular basis, and I'll ask them things like, how's it going? And they'll say, yeah, I think I'm going to quit. I'm like, why? They're like, I'm not making an impact. I'm like, you know you've been here eight months, right?","words":[{"text":"Relationships","start":1.16,"end":1.52,"punct":","},{"text":"career","start":2.08,"end":2.08,"punct":","},{"text":"are","start":2.7,"end":2.76},{"text":"not","start":2.76,"end":2.96},{"text":"destinations","start":2.96,"end":3.64,"punct":","},{"text":"like","start":4.04,"end":4.12,"punct":","},{"text":"look","start":4.3,"end":4.42,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":4.52,"end":4.6},{"text":"found","start":4.6,"end":4.8},{"text":"the","start":4.8,"end":4.94},{"text":"job","start":4.94,"end":5.08},{"text":"I","start":5.08,"end":5.24},{"text":"love","start":5.24,"end":5.5,"punct":"."},{"text":"That's","start":6.1,"end":6.32},{"text":"not","start":6.32,"end":6.44},{"text":"how","start":6.44,"end":6.54},{"text":"it","start":6.54,"end":6.66},{"text":"works","start":6.66,"end":6.94,"punct":"."},{"text":"It's","start":7.22,"end":7.38},{"text":"not","start":7.38,"end":7.56},{"text":"a","start":7.56,"end":7.98},{"text":"scavenger","start":7.98,"end":8.62},{"text":"hunt","start":8.62,"end":8.84,"punct":"."},{"text":"I'm","start":9.72,"end":10.08},{"text":"looking","start":10.08,"end":10.3},{"text":"for","start":10.3,"end":10.54},{"text":"the","start":10.54,"end":10.64},{"